  "title": "NOVA Palm Pro 510 Battery (Metallic Edition)",
  "description": "Introducing the Palm Pro, a game-changer in the NOVA family. Designed for 510 thread cartridges, this battery offers stepless voltage adjustment from 1.8V to 4.2V, ensuring compatibility with a wide range of cart oils for optimal flavour and vapor production!\n\nThe built-in LCD screen provides real-time data on puff counts, voltage settings, heating modes, and battery status, while the ambient light adds another stylish touch to your sessions. A Compact yet Versatile 510 battery.\n\nWhether you’re a beginner or an experienced vaper, the Nova Palm Pro delivers convenience and performance in one sleek package, making it an essential accessory for any enthusiast seeking a premium vaping experience.\n\nSPECS\n\n- Voltage: adjustable from 1.8V ~ 4.2V (in increments of 0.1V)\n\n- Display: LCD screen with ambient light\n\n- Battery capacity: 550mAh rechargeable\n\n- Charging port: TYPE-C\n\n- Compatibility: Compatible with 510 thread carts",
